{"schema":"mao-cross-channel-public-site-data/1","script":"0054","rows":[{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0054:00000039:text","row":14508,"ordinal":1,"kind":"text","jp":"「掃除、手伝おうか？」","en":"‘Want some help cleaning?’","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:001179","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0009a:00001","en":"Taichi: \"So, cleaning, can I help you?\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["grammar","idiom_calque","register_voice"],"assessment":"The offer to help with the cleaning is accurate, but the topic-fronted English is fragmented and unnatural for a simple offer.","remedy":"Use 'Want some help cleaning?'","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":38,"start":9,"text":"So, cleaning, can I help you?"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0054:000000ed:text","row":14509,"ordinal":2,"kind":"text","jp":"「今は優しいモードですね」","en":"‘You're in Kind Mode right now.’","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:001180","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0009a:00002","en":"Miki: \"You're in nice guy mode right now.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["register_voice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0054:00000127:text","row":14510,"ordinal":3,"kind":"text","jp":"「はい？」","en":"‘Excuse me?’","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:001181","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0009a:00003","en":"Taichi: \"What?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["register_voice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0054:000001cf:text","row":14511,"ordinal":4,"kind":"text","jp":"「先輩にはセクハラモードと優しいモードの二つの機能が備わっているんですよ。えっへり」","en":"‘You come equipped with two settings: Harassment Mode and Kind Mode. Ta-da.’","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:001182","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0009a:00004","en":"Miki: \"Because you come with two settings, Senpai, Sexual Harassment Mode and Nice Guy Mode. Eheh'ryh!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["wordplay","register_voice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0054:0000023b:text","row":14512,"ordinal":5,"kind":"text","jp":"寄せてあげることもままならない平らな胸を張った。","en":"She proudly thrust out a chest too flat for even a push-up bra to push together or up.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:001183","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0009a:00005","en":"She pushed out a chest that you couldn't fondle by putting your hands on it.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation","wordplay","presentation"],"assessment":"The source jokes that her chest is so flat it cannot even be pushed together and lifted for cleavage. The English replaces that visual bra-related joke with an unrelated claim that the chest cannot be fondled by hand.","remedy":"Use 'She thrust out a chest so flat there was nothing to push together or lift.'","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":75,"start":15,"text":"a chest that you couldn't fondle by putting your hands on it"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0054:0000028b:text","row":14513,"ordinal":6,"kind":"text","jp":"「む……」","en":"‘Ngh...’","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:001184","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0009a:00006","en":"Taichi: \"Mnuh...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["register_voice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0054:00000333:text","row":14514,"ordinal":7,"kind":"text","jp":"「あ、照れてる」","en":"‘Oh, you're blushing.’","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:001185","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0009a:00007","en":"Miki: \"Ah, I've embarrassed you.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["register_voice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0054:00000363:text","row":14515,"ordinal":8,"kind":"text","jp":"「照れてませんっ！」","en":"‘I am not!’","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:001186","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0009a:00008","en":"Taichi: \"I am not embarrassed!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["register_voice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0054:00000415:text","row":14516,"ordinal":9,"kind":"text","jp":"「むきになるところが」","en":"‘The way you get all worked up says otherwise.’","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:001187","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0009a:00009","en":"Miki: \"But you still took that so seriously.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["register_voice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0054:0000044b:text","row":14517,"ordinal":10,"kind":"text","jp":"「それより掃除だ。急げ、時間がないぞ！」","en":"‘Never mind that. We have cleaning to do. Hurry—we're out of time!’","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:001188","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0009a:00010","en":"Taichi: \"Let's just clean instead. Hurry, we don't have time!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["register_voice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0054:000004b0:text","row":14518,"ordinal":11,"kind":"text","jp":"「はーい」","en":"‘Okaaay.’","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:001189","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0009a:00011","en":"Miki: \"Yessir!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["register_voice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0054:0000058a:text","row":14519,"ordinal":12,"kind":"text","jp":"自分で捨てた雑巾を拾って、汚れに向かう。","en":"I picked up the rag I had thrown down and approached the stain.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:001190","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0009a:00012","en":"Grabbing back the rag that I had dropped earlier, I turn towards the uncleanliness.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation","idiom_calque","word_choice"],"assessment":"Dropped earlier is contextually defensible because he discarded the rag himself. The remaining defect is the abstract, nonidiomatic turn towards the uncleanliness for heading back to the stain.","remedy":"Say that he picked up the rag and headed for the stain.","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":82,"start":33,"text":"dropped earlier, I turn towards the uncleanliness"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0054:000005ca:text","row":14520,"ordinal":13,"kind":"text","jp":"血だった。","en":"It was blood.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:001191","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0009a:00013","en":"It was blood.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0054:0000069b:text","row":14521,"ordinal":14,"kind":"text","jp":"「うわああああああああああああっ！！？？」","en":"‘Aaaaaaaaaaaaaagh?!’","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:001192","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0009a:00014","en":"Taichi: \"EEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEK???!!!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["register_voice","presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0054:00000702:text","row":14522,"ordinal":15,"kind":"text","jp":"「えっ？」","en":"‘Huh?’","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:001193","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0009a:00015","en":"Miki: \"Eh?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["register_voice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0054:0000072c:text","row":14523,"ordinal":16,"kind":"text","jp":"「血、血じゃないか！」","en":"‘That's blood! Blood!’","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:001194","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0009a:00016","en":"Taichi: \"A-, ain't that blood!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["register_voice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0054:0000082b:text","row":14524,"ordinal":17,"kind":"text","jp":"正視できない。","en":"I couldn't bear to look.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:001195","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0009a:00017","en":"I can't look straight at it.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0054:00000851:text","row":14525,"ordinal":18,"kind":"text","jp":"雑巾で顔を隠す。","en":"I hid my face behind the rag.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:001196","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0009a:00018","en":"I hide my face behind the rag.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0054:00000881:text","row":14526,"ordinal":19,"kind":"text","jp":"「は、はやく拭き取ってぇーっ！」","en":"‘W-Wipe it up! Hurry!’","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:001197","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0009a:00019","en":"Taichi: \"Hu-, hurry up and clean it awaaay!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["register_voice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0054:000008de:text","row":14527,"ordinal":20,"kind":"text","jp":"「はいはい、待っててください」","en":"‘All right, all right. Wait there.’","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:001198","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0009a:00020","en":"Miki: \"Yes, yes, please wait.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["register_voice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0054:00000914:text","row":14528,"ordinal":21,"kind":"text","jp":"ほどなくして。","en":"A moment later—","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:001199","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0009a:00021","en":"And before long,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0054:0000095f:text","row":14529,"ordinal":22,"kind":"text","jp":"「はい、おしまい」","en":"‘There. All done.’","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:001200","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0009a:00022","en":"Miki: \"There, all done.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["register_voice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0054:00000991:text","row":14530,"ordinal":23,"kind":"text","jp":"「もうきれい？」","en":"‘It's clean now?’","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:001201","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0009a:00023","en":"Taichi: \"All clean now?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["register_voice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0054:000009de:text","row":14531,"ordinal":24,"kind":"text","jp":"「大丈夫ですよ」","en":"‘You can look.’","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:001202","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0009a:00024","en":"Miki: \"It's all done.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["register_voice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0054:00000ad7:text","row":14532,"ordinal":25,"kind":"text","jp":"雑巾を顔から離す。","en":"I lowered the rag from my face.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:001203","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0009a:00025","en":"I unhide my face from behind the rag.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["grammar","idiom_calque","presentation"],"assessment":"The source simply says he lowers or moves the rag away from his face. 'Unhide my face from behind' is a cumbersome negative construction rather than natural physical description.","remedy":"Use 'I lowered the rag from my face.'","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":36,"start":2,"text":"unhide my face from behind the rag"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0054:00000b09:text","row":14533,"ordinal":26,"kind":"text","jp":"「うー、血弱くてさ」","en":"‘Ugh. I'm terrible with blood.’","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:001204","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0009a:00026","en":"Taichi: \"Ngggh, I'm weak to blood.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["idiom_calque","word_choice"],"assessment":"The meaning that he cannot handle blood is recognizable, but 'weak to blood' is a game-stat calque rather than idiomatic English for this sensitivity.","remedy":"Use 'I'm really bad with blood.'","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":33,"start":20,"text":"weak to blood"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0054:00000bbb:text","row":14534,"ordinal":27,"kind":"text","jp":"「そんな可愛い一面があったのですね」","en":"‘I never knew you had such an adorable side.’","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:001205","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0009a:00027","en":"Miki: \"So you had an adorable side to you.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["register_voice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0054:00000bff:text","row":14535,"ordinal":28,"kind":"text","jp":"「正直、きついっす」","en":"‘Honestly, I can't take it.’","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:001206","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0009a:00028","en":"Taichi: \"Honestly, that's harsh...\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation","register_voice","logical_relation"],"assessment":"The speaker says that his physical reaction is honestly rough or hard to bear. 'That's harsh' instead sounds like a response to the preceding teasing remark and shifts the line away from his condition.","remedy":"Use 'Honestly, this is rough.'","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":31,"start":19,"text":"that's harsh"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0054:00000c2b:text","row":14536,"ordinal":29,"kind":"text","jp":"ちらっと見ただけで、まだ気分が悪い。","en":"One glimpse had been enough to turn my stomach.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:001207","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0009a:00029","en":"I still feel sick despite having just glimpsed at it.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["grammar","idiom_calque","logical_relation"],"assessment":"The source says even a mere glance has left him still feeling sick. 'Glimpsed at' is ungrammatical, and 'despite' weakens the causal force of the small exposure producing the reaction.","remedy":"Use 'One little glance, and I still feel sick.'","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":52,"start":18,"text":"despite having just glimpsed at it"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0054:00000c6f:text","row":14537,"ordinal":30,"kind":"text","jp":"「役立たずでごめん」","en":"‘Sorry I'm useless.’","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:001208","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0009a:00030","en":"Taichi: \"Sorry for being useless.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["register_voice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0054:00000ca3:text","row":14538,"ordinal":31,"kind":"text","jp":"「豚とののしってくれ……」","en":"‘Call me a pig...’","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:001209","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0009a:00031","en":"Taichi: \"Please abuse this worthless pig...\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation","addition","register_voice"],"assessment":"The source asks her to insult him by calling him a pig. The English instead calls him a worthless pig in the narration of the request and asks for general abuse, adding the judgment and weakening the specific requested wording.","remedy":"Use 'Call me a pig...'","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":40,"start":16,"text":"abuse this worthless pig"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0054:00000d5b:text","row":14539,"ordinal":32,"kind":"text","jp":"「え……？」","en":"‘What...?’","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:001210","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0009a:00032","en":"Miki: \"Ehhh...?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["register_voice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0054:00000d87:text","row":14540,"ordinal":33,"kind":"text","jp":"「どうか豚と」","en":"‘Please. Call me a pig.’","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:001211","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0009a:00033","en":"Taichi: \"Like an oinker treat me.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation","grammar","register_voice"],"assessment":"He repeats his plea to be called a pig. 'Treat me like an oinker' substitutes treatment for naming, softens 'pig,' and uses inverted, unidiomatic syntax.","remedy":"Use 'Please. Call me a pig.'","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":33,"start":9,"text":"Like an oinker treat me."}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0054:00000e33:text","row":14541,"ordinal":34,"kind":"text","jp":"「……じゃあ」","en":"‘...Then...’","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:001212","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0009a:00034","en":"Miki: \"...theeen...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["register_voice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0054:00000e7e:text","row":14542,"ordinal":35,"kind":"text","jp":"「豚は豚箱に行け？」","en":"‘Does the pig belong in the pen?’","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:001213","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0009a:00035","en":"Miki: \"Piggy wants to pig out in the pigpen?\"","verdict":"questionable","categories":["mistranslation","wordplay","logical_relation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0054:00000eb2:text","row":14543,"ordinal":36,"kind":"text","jp":"「ぐっ」","en":"‘Guh.’","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:001214","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0009a:00036","en":"Taichi: \"Ngh!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["register_voice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0054:00000ed2:text","row":14544,"ordinal":37,"kind":"text","jp":"アレンジされた上、疑問形式なのが妙にきつかった。","en":"The added flourish hurt. The fact that she phrased it as a question hurt even more.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:001215","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0009a:00037","en":"That arrangement being then put in the form of a question made it oddly painful.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["idiom_calque","grammar","presentation"],"assessment":"The source says her improvised variation, especially being phrased as a question, struck oddly hard. The English nominalizes the whole thought into an ungainly progressive construction.","remedy":"Use 'Her little improvisation—and the fact that she made it a question—hurt in a strangely specific way.'","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":57,"start":0,"text":"That arrangement being then put in the form of a question"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0054:00000fa0:text","row":14545,"ordinal":38,"kind":"text","jp":"「豚箱より保健室いきませんか？」","en":"‘Instead of the pen, how about the nurse's office?’","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:001216","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0009a:00038","en":"Miki: \"Rather than the pigpen, would you like to go the infirmary?\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["grammar","idiom_calque"],"assessment":"The alternative suggestion of going to the infirmary is accurate, but the English omits the required preposition 'to.'","remedy":"Use 'Rather than the pigpen, would you like to go to the infirmary?'","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":65,"start":49,"text":"go the infirmary"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0054:00000fe0:text","row":14546,"ordinal":39,"kind":"text","jp":"「いや、平気だと思う」","en":"‘No, I think I'll be fine.’","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:001217","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0009a:00039","en":"Taichi: \"Naaah, I think I'll be alright.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["register_voice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0054:00001033:text","row":14547,"ordinal":40,"kind":"text","jp":"「……うーん」","en":"‘...Hmm.’","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:001218","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0009a:00040","en":"Miki: \"...uh-huh.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation","register_voice","logical_relation"],"assessment":"The drawn-out sound expresses hesitation or doubt. 'Uh-huh' conventionally signals agreement, reversing her response to his reassurance.","remedy":"Use '...Hmm.'","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":16,"start":10,"text":"uh-huh"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0054:00001061:text","row":14548,"ordinal":41,"kind":"text","jp":"「平気だって」","en":"‘I said I'm fine.’","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:001219","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0009a:00041","en":"Taichi: \"I'll be alright!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["register_voice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0054:0000110d:text","row":14549,"ordinal":42,"kind":"text","jp":"「そのまま一緒にお昼寝しましょう」","en":"‘We could take a nap together while we're there.’","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:001220","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0009a:00042","en":"Miki: \"Let's take a nice daytime nap while we're there.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["register_voice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0054:0000114f:text","row":14550,"ordinal":43,"kind":"text","jp":"「ぐっ……」","en":"‘Guh...’","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:001221","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0009a:00043","en":"Taichi: \"Guh...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["register_voice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0054:00001173:text","row":14551,"ordinal":44,"kind":"text","jp":"その提案は、後ろ髪を引きすぎる。","en":"That offer was dangerously tempting.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:001222","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0009a:00044","en":"That proposal made the hair on the back of my head stand way up.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation","idiom_calque","logical_relation"],"assessment":"The idiom says the proposal is far too tempting to leave behind. The English reads the body-part image literally and turns attraction or reluctance to depart into alarm or gooseflesh.","remedy":"Use 'That offer was far too tempting.'","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":63,"start":14,"text":"made the hair on the back of my head stand way up"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0054:000011d0:text","row":14552,"ordinal":45,"kind":"text","jp":"「ベッドも二つありますし」","en":"‘There are two beds.’","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:001223","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0009a:00045","en":"Miki: \"There are at least two beds there.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["addition","logical_relation","word_choice"],"assessment":"She adds that there are two beds. 'At least' changes the exact count into a lower bound and introduces uncertainty absent from the source.","remedy":"Use 'There are two beds there, too.'","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":34,"start":17,"text":"at least two beds"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0054:0000120a:text","row":14553,"ordinal":46,"kind":"text","jp":"「じゃあまた」","en":"‘See you later.’","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:001224","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0009a:00046","en":"Taichi: \"Wellbye.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["register_voice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0054:000012b6:text","row":14554,"ordinal":47,"kind":"text","jp":"「あら……？」","en":"‘Oh...?’","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:001225","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0009a:00047","en":"Miki: \"Dear me...?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["register_voice"]}]}]}
